# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TradingAgents Viewer — Non-sensitive Configuration
#
# API keys and passwords are NO LONGER stored here.
# They live in individual files under ./secrets/ — run this to set them up:
#
#   chmod +x scripts/create_secrets.sh && ./scripts/create_secrets.sh
#
# This .env file only contains non-sensitive configuration that is safe
# to keep in version control or share with teammates.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Storage ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Path on the HOST (Linode VM) where your Block Storage volume is mounted.
# Linode typically mounts volumes at /mnt/<label> — adjust to match yours.
REPORTS_HOST_PATH=/mnt/reports

# ── Reddit (non-sensitive) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The user-agent string for Reddit API calls — not a secret.
REDDIT_USER_AGENT=tradingagents-deploy
